            {
                "comment": "Carly is a really nice person (super sweet), but I didn't really like her as a teacher. Her teaching was her reading off of a powerpoint. I know that she didn't like grammar so maybe that was why she relied so heavily on the slides... Overall an easy A, show up, do your work and you'll be fine.",
